https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/122620","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/122620","diff_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/122620.diff","patch_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/122620.patch","merged_at":"2026-08-20T15:54:57Z"},"body":"## What problem(s) does this PR solve?\r\n\r\nThis regression was caused by #119312, which makes the first selectable item be highlighted on the popop gains focus. This means that if the focus is gained by clicking an unselectable item (a separator, for example), this will happen.\r\n\r\nThis PR fixes that by instead dealing with the \"ui_focus_*\" events itself, and switching the focus accordingly.\r\n\r\n## Additional information\r\n\r\nThe diff looks a little messy, but that is mostly because I enclosed all the `is_action()` checks inside a `is_pressed()` block, since all of them used it. I also offloaded a loop used multiple times into its own function.\r\n\r\n- *Bugsquad:* closes godotengine/godot-proposals#15333","closed_by":{"login":"Repiteo","id":17489292,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE3NDg5Mjky","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/17489292?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo","html_url":"https://github.com/Repiteo","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"reactions":{"url":"https://api.gi